  "vehicleId": 1,
  "rating": 4,
  "comment": "Punctual and clean matatu."
}


###

### 38. Feedback — validation error (rating out of range, expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/feedback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleId": 1,
  "rating": 6,
  "comment": "This should fail."
}


