# ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
# ║               ERROR / EDGE CASE TESTS                   ║
# ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

### 50. Signed out — expect 401 (sign out with 6 first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/stages


###

### 51. Wrong role — signed in as a Passenger, hitting an Admin endpoint (expect 403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/dashboard-data


###

### 52. Malformed JSON body — expect 400
PUT {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "bad",


###

### 55. Health check (database reachability) — no auth
GET {{baseUrl}}/health


###

### 56. Run one ETA cycle (what Vercel Cron / a scheduler calls) — needs CRON_SECRET
@cronSecret = PASTE_CRON_SECRET_HERE
GET {{baseUrl}}/cron/eta-cycle
Authorization: Bearer {{cronSecret}}
